§1 · PROVING THE HELPERS BEFORE THEY CARRY A RESULT
  SEVERE     the censored geometric MLE recovers a rate it was not told
  SEVERE     censored observations contribute exposure, so ignoring them raises the rate
  SEVERE     annualisation strictly raises a positive quarterly hazard
  SEVERE     the four α-regimes are exhaustive and ordered
  SEVERE     the discrete Weibull nests the geometric at k = 1
  SEVERE     N_co counts stacked firm-quarters and not spread ones
  SEVERE     the null preserves every per-firm, per-tier marginal exactly
  SEVERE     the power injection MOVES rather than adds, so the null is unchanged by it
  SEVERE     moving preserves the event count; the adding witness really does differ
  SEVERE     a fully censored cell returns UNDEFINED rather than a number

